          There is no such thing as a gravity reverse osmosis pitcher. The membrane needs far more pressure than a few inches of water can supply, so every product that delivers genuine RO water into a pitcher is a plug-in countertop appliance with a pump. That is fine, as long as you buy one for the right reasons. If you need dissolved solids, fluoride or nitrate out of your water without plumbing, the AquaTru Classic Smart has the best published certification, and the AquaTru Glass Carafe is the one to buy if you want that water poured from glass.
