          <p>
            None of this means the less-certified units do not work. An RO membrane is an RO membrane, and lab test results from SGS are real data. It means the claim has not been independently checked against a standard and kept under review. If a specific contaminant is the reason you are buying, look the exact model up in the IAPMO, NSF or WQA database before you buy. We list only what the makers publish and have not re-run their tests.
          </p>
