          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Buy a countertop reverse osmosis unit if your water report shows dissolved solids, fluoride, nitrate or arsenic that a carbon pitcher cannot touch, and you cannot or do not want to plumb in an under-sink system. Do not buy one to fix chlorine taste; a certified carbon pitcher does that for a fraction of the price. For documented performance, the AquaTru Classic Smart has the deepest published certification on this list.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
